        "y": 220
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "Murder by persons unknown",
        "description": "Kell writes Prout's death down as murder by persons unknown, so he goes to the watch-house cold room and not the suicides' pit. Nobody has been named, but the case stays open.",
        "closing": "Kell writes one line and underlines it; Prout will go on the cart under a sheet, as a murder. She tells the player, drily, that an open case beats a wrong one.",
        "result": "good",
        "exitKind": "progress",
        "next": "caerwyn-afternoon",
