      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "Filed as a suicide",
        "description": "Prout goes into the Captain's book as a suicide and onto the dead-cart for the pit outside the north gate. Nobody will look for whoever killed him.",
        "closing": "Kell writes one word in her notebook and shuts it. Prout goes out of the yard on the dead-cart under a sheet, past the Assembly bunting (at noon, if it isn't here yet). Let the kids react.",
