      "data": {
        "condition": "The player pushes Cob to tell who was in the loft last night, or about the boots, with an appeal or an argument, while he's still holding out and it could go either way. (Not just asking. A promise that truly answers what he's afraid of, his name kept out of it and the men from the loft kept off him, needs no dice: that's not this.)",
